<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a name="_Hlk184646743" style="font-size: 12pt;">Good <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">morning/afternoon</span> <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">Client</span>,</a></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk184646743">I hope you are
well. I’d like to introduce myself as your HR specialist and client liaison.&nbsp;I
work as your strategic partner to understand your unique business needs and
goals so that I can make recommendations to best maximize Insperity’s services.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk184646743">I’d like to
schedule a call to discuss the Insperity partnership, your company’s goals and
objectives, and begin to build a plan in which we can best assist you in
achieving those goals.&nbsp; Please let me know what time works best for you,
and I will send a calendar invite. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk184646743">I
have attached your Service Team contact sheet so you can identify the various
Insperity team members that support you as well you, as well as their role
descriptions. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">I look forward to
working with you.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk184646743">Please let me know
if you have any questions.</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
